---

<section class="import-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="import-card">
      <span class="import-icon">📥</span>
      <h2>Already planning in Excel or Google Sheets?</h2>
      <p>
        Download the Tayo Na template, fill it in at your own pace, and import
        it into the app in one click. Your destinations, activities, members,
        and budget come with it.
      </p>
      <div class="import-actions">
        <a
          href="/templates/TayoNa_Trip_Import_Template.xlsx"
          download
          class="btn btn-primary"
        >
          ↓ Download Template
        </a>
        <a href="https://tayona.app" class="btn btn-secondary">
          Open the App
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="import-hint">
        Works with Microsoft Excel and Google Sheets.<br />
        Google Sheets: File → Download → Microsoft Excel (.xlsx)
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .import-section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .import-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .import-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .import-card h2 {
    font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .import-card > p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  }

  .import-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .import-hint {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
